hree messages are the system arrival notice and two driver messages - so the clause never engages and I do not reach limbs (b) or (c).\n\nOn the rider's remaining points. Your account that you were in the terminal the whole time is not something the charge turns on: the chargeable no-show test asks about the driver's conduct, and the rider position track (all 88 fixes reporting 45-80 m accuracy, excluded by the same 25 m filter) is undecidable rather than adverse - I neither find you were at the pin nor that you were away from it (POL-NS-11). The two driver messages and the arrival notice were delivered but never read (read_at null), which explains why you saw them late; it does not undo a correctly measured wait. The undecidable rider track and your unrebutted narrative are therefore accepted but do not move the fee.\n\nOn the driver's $4.80 (driver). POL-NS-07 fixes the payout at 80% of the $6.00 fee in force = $4.80, the figure the fare breakdown itself derives. The anti-farming guard does not fire: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1 (below the threshold of 4) and 1 divided by 168 completed trips is 0.006 (below the 0.08 rate).\n\nImpairments disclosed (POL-GEN-02(3)). EV-CHAT-00202, weight 0.85, issue UNREAD_MESSAGE - it shows delivery, not receipt, and carries no deciding fact. EV-DPROF-00202, weight 0.9, issue SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH - immaterial, because the two counters it is read for sit an order of magnitude clear of both thresholds, so the compensation finding survives the discount. EV-ADVIS-00202-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0: no traffic advisory covers this kerbside, so the accumulation route in POL-NS-06(i) is unavailable and the driver does not claim it. The deciding facts - arrival, dwell, termination and the fee - rest on COMPLETE artifacts at weight 1.0 (EV-GPS-00202, EV-TRIP-00202, EV-FARE-00202), so confidence is not capped below 0.90 and stays above the 0.70 floor. No POL-NS-09 escalation trigger fires: no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or presence; the trailing-90-day counterparty dispute counts are both 0; the anti-farming check does not trip; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 1; and the deciding evidence is unimpaired under POL-NS-08(a)-(d). No clause produces a referral. The monetary effect of $4.80 is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of $8.00 and executes automatically, subject to the appeal route under POL-GEN-04."
  },
