    {
      "claim": "No POL-NS-09 trigger fires, so a monetary ruling is available and the fee need not be held for review. There is no direct contradiction between admissible artifacts on arrival or dwell - the trip record's wait_time_min of 10.2 is consistent with the trace's 620-second run; rider_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d and driver_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d are both 0; the anti-farming check does not trip; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 1, below the 3 the clause requires; and the deciding facts are carried by COMPLETE artifacts at weight 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) confidence cap does not fall below the 0.70 floor.",
